{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "178a480f-b125-8e52-9b7d-0cfe16ab2d5d",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T13:57:30-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Josephine DeLuca",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:54:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:54:59-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good afternoon. I'm calling about the snow. Well, the ice now, after the rain. I'm on speaker, I have my hands full, so tell me if you can't hear me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:55:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. Go ahead. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:55:14-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's my neighbor. She's elderly, lives alone, and she can't get out of her house. The sidewalk and the front steps are solid ice from the storm Sunday into Monday, the snow and then the rain on top of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:55:27-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So the snow turned to rain and then it froze up on her. Where is this, what's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:55:34-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "314 Mill Street. Up on Historic Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:55:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "314 Mill Street. Is that the house you're calling about, or the neighbor's?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:55:42-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the building. I rent there, she's in the unit next to mine. Same front walk. [pause] Um, Mamãe, un momentu, mi sta na telefoni. Sorry. My aunt was asking me something."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:55:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:55:56-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So I got up before dawn this morning to catch the early train, and I almost went down on the steps myself. It's bad. I'd like to ask for sand. Can somebody bring sand, or can I pick some up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:56:10-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me make sure I have this right. You need sand for the walk and steps at 314 Mill Street, because your neighbor can't get out. Is that it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:56:20-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. And she needs a path, a clear way out to the street. If she has to go to the doctor or anything. Right now she can't."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:56:29-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. The street plows handle the roadway, they don't do private walks or steps. But we can get sand out to you. Is there a spot at the curb where a crew could drop a bucket, or would you rather come get it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:56:43-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can come get it. I don't have a car, but it's not far. Is it heavy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:56:49-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A bucket or two, so it can be. Let me put in a request for delivery instead, since you've got the neighbor to look after. Can I get a callback number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:57:02-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0195."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:57:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-five. And that's Josephine?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:57:07-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Josephine DeLuca. D-e, capital L-u-c-a."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:57:09-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I'm writing: sand delivery, 314 Mill Street, icy front walk and steps, elderly neighbor unable to leave. It should go out this afternoon or tomorrow morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:57:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. This afternoon would be better, but okay. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:57:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Josephine. Be careful on those steps till it comes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:57:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Thank you. Bye now."
    }
  ],
